# tests/adapt F-02/F-03: growth beyond the init cutoff radius without max_radius must stop with a clean collective ERROR (was: hang). 2 ranks.
# 2 ranks along x; all particles live in the left half, so rank 1 owns none.
# Radius grows by 0.6*skin per application => rank 0 calls trigger_build(), rank 1 does not.
# Run: timeout 120 mpirun -np 2 lmp -in in.adapt_rank_divergence ; expected (hypothesis): hang or MPI error.
atom_style    granular
atom_modify   map array
boundary      f f f
newton        off
communicate   single vel yes
processors    2 1 1
units         si
region        reg block -0.05 0.05 -0.02 0.02 -0.02 0.02 units box
create_box    1 reg
neighbor      0.001 bin
neigh_modify  delay 0
fix  m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 1e7
fix  m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix  m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix  m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.5
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history
pair_coeff * *
timestep 1e-6
region left block -0.045 -0.005 -0.015 0.015 -0.015 0.015 units box
lattice sc 0.01
create_atoms 1 region left
set group all diameter 0.001 density 2500
variable r equal 0.0005+0.0006*floor(step/10)
fix integr all nve/sphere
fix grow all adapt/liggghts 10 radius v_r
thermo_style custom step atoms v_r
thermo 10
run 40
